[com_19]
type=text
x=29
y=25
width=179
height=251
layer=com_2
textfont=fontmetrics_5631
fontmono=no
text=  - On the Infernal Legions - <br><br>  Woe to the world; it languishes beneath the demon's cloven hoof!  It is known without doubt that the demonic legions amass and grow stronger.  They may appear without warning, in places of sorrow and rot, or any wild and remote location.<br><br>  There the world bears witness to the arrival of those most dangerous of the fellborn: the demonic generals.
colour=0x010000

[com_20]
type=graphic
width=240
height=150
layer=com_4
graphic="aif_demon_flash_mob_2,0"

[com_21]
type=graphic
width=240
height=150
xmode=abs_right
layer=com_4
graphic="aif_demon_flash_mob_2,1"

[com_22]
type=graphic
width=240
height=150
ymode=abs_bottom
layer=com_4
graphic="aif_demon_flash_mob_2,2"

[com_23]
type=graphic
width=240
height=150
xmode=abs_right
ymode=abs_bottom
layer=com_4
graphic="aif_demon_flash_mob_2,3"

[com_24]
type=text
x=29
y=25
width=179
height=251
layer=com_4
textfont=fontmetrics_5631
fontmono=no
text=  Many are the forms and names of these fiends, these lords of the pit.  They come arrayed for war, with gleaming tusk and iron claw.  Nothing may stand against their fury.  Nothing is left in their wake but ruination.<br><br>  As a fire hungers for fuel, so too do they hunger for blood and suffering.  Every blow they land heals them of even the most grievous wounds.  Beware, lest by facing your foe you pave the way to your doom!
colour=0x010000

[com_25]
type=graphic
width=240
height=150
layer=com_5
graphic="aif_demon_flash_mob_3,0"

[com_26]
type=graphic
width=240
height=150
xmode=abs_right
layer=com_5
graphic="aif_demon_flash_mob_3,1"

[com_27]
type=graphic
width=240
height=150
ymode=abs_bottom
layer=com_5
graphic="aif_demon_flash_mob_3,2"

[com_28]
type=graphic
width=240
height=150
xmode=abs_right
ymode=abs_bottom
layer=com_5
graphic="aif_demon_flash_mob_3,3"

[com_29]
type=text
x=29
y=25
width=179
height=251
layer=com_5
textfont=fontmetrics_5631
fontmono=no
text=  But in this, take heart: breaching the veil of this world causes them terrible wounds.  Before it may unleash its fury upon the world it must first shed the blood of its closest followers.<br><br>  Each general is accompanied by many companions.  The general will slay each footman in turn and the blood of this sacrifice will fuel its rebirth.
colour=0x010000

[com_30]
type=graphic
width=240
height=150
layer=com_6
graphic="aif_demon_flash_mob_4,0"

[com_31]
type=graphic
width=240
height=150
xmode=abs_right
layer=com_6
graphic="aif_demon_flash_mob_4,1"

[com_32]
type=graphic
width=240
height=150
ymode=abs_bottom
layer=com_6
graphic="aif_demon_flash_mob_4,2"

[com_33]
type=graphic
width=240
height=150
xmode=abs_right
ymode=abs_bottom
layer=com_6
graphic="aif_demon_flash_mob_4,3"

[com_34]
type=text
x=29
y=25
width=179
height=251
layer=com_6
textfont=fontmetrics_5631
fontmono=no
text=Once they lie dead, the general will turn upon his lieutenants and in betrayal drain them of energy to become mighty indeed.<br><br>Slay first the general's heralds.  With them dispatched, he will direct his footmen to destroy you.<br><br>  Slay next the footmen, for without them the general will be sorely weakened.
colour=0x010000

